  "content": "\n\n<h1><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/jmJ87gsb/images/527602ce254ed3b68f42d40960928767639d7760.png\" width=\"808\" height=\"444\"></h1>\n<h3>&nbsp;</h3>\n<h3><strong>關於：</strong></h3>\n<p><strong>Delightful Creators&nbsp;</strong>是《<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-delight-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">Farmer's Delight</a>》與&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create</a>&nbsp;的附加模組，使用&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create</a> 新增各種合成配方。目前新增了多種流體與配方，非常適合用於整合包。</p>\n<p>此外還有支援《<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-respite-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">Farmer's Respite</a>》的<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/respite-creators-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">模組</a>。</p>\n<p>Forge 版本請見<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/delightful-creators-forge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處</a>！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><strong>目前內容：</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>為序列組裝（Sequenced Assembly）新增未完成的食材。</li>\n<li>為湯品、燉菜與醬汁等新增流體。</li>\n<li>可透過攪拌機混合素材來製作流體。</li>\n<li>可將燉菜或湯品盛入碗中。</li>\n<li>可切開南瓜派。</li>\n<li>蜂蜜與甜莓餅乾的合成配方。</li>\n<li>巧克力派的合成配方。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><strong>語言支援：</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>英文 (en_us)&nbsp;-&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/Flomik\" rel=\"nofollow\">Flomik</a></li>\n<li>俄文 (ru_ru) -&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/Flomik\" rel=\"nofollow\">Flomik</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fclients%252faff.php%253faff%253d6136\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/4JkTnRF/banner.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"180\" height=\"180\"></a></p>",
